New in 0.15.0
• Every meal now has a length: 1 hour by default, adjustable in the editor. Record cards show "12:30 – 13:30". Earlier meals count as 1 hour; you can edit them.
• Your fast now starts when your last meal ends. One-meal days are unchanged; with more meals in a day, the fast starts and ends later by the last meal's length.
• The Record tab shows each meal's place and can be searched by name or address.
• Better screen-reader labels, and more screens speak your app language.
